;; The launch lift from Updraft Edge (columns 8-10) tops out under the roof.
;; Steer east onto the lip (row 3) and on through the low gap into B, or
;; west onto the landing where E's chute (columns 2-3) comes down. The lip
;; is seven tiles above B's floor: the drop is one way. Releasing jump in
;; the column falls back down the throat to the Hollow.
